OL,3,AThese North Koreans say they were spied
OL,4,Aon, beaten and jailed for being
OL,5,AChristian
OL,6,
OL,7,FLiving in North Korea, Kim Bo-bin got
OL,8,Fused to praying with her eyes open.
OL,10,FShe found ingenious ways to keep her
OL,11,FChristian faith a secret in the
OL,12,FCommunist dictatorship, which tightly
OL,13,Fcontrols how and where its citizens
OL,14,Fworship. Unauthorised displays of faith
OL,15,Fcould land people in prison, she tells
OL,16,Fthe BBC.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
