OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AThese North Koreans say they were spied
OL,4,Aon, beaten and jailed for being
OL,5,AChristian
OL,6,
OL,7,FSo Kim would silently mouth hymns and
OL,8,Fclap with just two of her fingers. "In
OL,9,FNorth Korea, if there are three people
OL,10,Fin a room, you are being spied on. So I
OL,11,Fwould only close my eyes [and pray]
OL,12,Fwhen I lay on the floor."
OL,14,FNow 44, Kim lives just outside the
OL,15,FSouth Korean capital Seoul, where she
OL,16,Ffled 15 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
